TI  - VALIDITY OF CONTENT BY EXPERT JUDGEMENT IN RUBRICS IN THE CONTEXT OF A LABORATORY ON MAGNETISM TOPICS
T2  - GONDOLA-ENSENANZA Y APRENDIZAJE DE LAS CIENCIAS
