TI  - Fostering entrepreneurial mindsets: the impact of learning motivation, personal innovativeness, technological self-efficacy, and human capital on entrepreneurial intention
T2  - JOURNAL OF INTERNATIONAL EDUCATION IN BUSINESS
LA  - English
KW  - Learning motivation
KW  - Personal innovativeness
KW  - Technological self-efficacy
KW  - Human capital
KW  - Entrepreneurship intention
