TI  - Mobile application as a pedagogical strategy to strengthen generic skills in students at the Popular University of Cesar
T2  - REDHECS-REVISTA ELECTRONICA DE HUMANIDADES EDUCACION Y COMUNICACION SOCIAL
LA  - Spanish
