TI  - MAPPING GENAI LITERACY: DISCIPLINARY DIFFERENCES, LATENT PROFILES, AND PERCEPTIONS AMONG EMI UNDERGRADUATES
T2  - JOURNAL OF INFORMATION TECHNOLOGY EDUCATION-RESEARCH
LA  - English
